{"id": "3286793", "name": "נגזרות חלקיות מסדר שני בנקודה חריגה – f_xy ו-f_yx", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">נגזרות חלקיות מסדר שני בנקודה חריגה</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\">נתונה הפונקציה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f(x,y)= \\begin{cases} \\dfrac{{{CT:0}}}{{{CT:1}}},&amp;(x,y)\\ne(0,0)\\\\ 0,&amp;(x,y)=(0,0) \\end{cases} \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0;\">את הנגזרות בנקודה \\((0,0)\\) יש לחשב מן ההגדרה המתאימה.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">א</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">נגזרות טהורות מסדר שני</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 12px 0;\">חשבו לפי ההגדרה את הנגזרות החלקיות הטהורות מסדר שני בראשית.</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f''_{xx}(0,0)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f''_{yy}(0,0)=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">ב</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">נגזרות מעורבות מסדר שני</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 12px 0;\">חשבו את שתי הנגזרות המעורבות בראשית.</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f''_{xy}(0,0)=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f''_{yx}(0,0)=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; background: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">ג</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">השוואת הנגזרות המעורבות</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\">האם התוצאות שקיבלתם עבור \\(f''_{xy}(0,0)\\) ו־\\(f''_{yx}(0,0)\\) סותרות את המשפט על שוויון הנגזרות המעורבות?</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans5]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 4px;\">[[validation:ans5]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; color: #1f2937;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">תחילה, מן ההגדרה מתקבל \\(f'_x(0,0)={{CT:2}}\\) ו־\\(f'_y(0,0)={{CT:3}}\\).</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">על ציר \\(x\\), עבור \\(x\\ne0\\), מתקבל \\(f'_x(x,0)={{CT:4}}\\), ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle f''_{xx}(0,0) = \\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f'_x(h,0)-f'_x(0,0)}{h} = {{CT:5}} \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">באופן דומה, \\(f'_y(0,y)={{CT:6}}\\), ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle f''_{yy}(0,0) = \\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f'_y(0,h)-f'_y(0,0)}{h} = {{CT:7}} \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">לנגזרות המעורבות, עבור \\(y\\ne0\\), \\(f'_x(0,y)={{CT:8}}\\), ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle f''_{xy}(0,0) = \\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f'_x(0,h)-f'_x(0,0)}{h} = {{CT:9}} \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">עבור \\(x\\ne0\\), \\(f'_y(x,0)={{CT:10}}\\), ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0 14px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle f''_{yx}(0,0) = \\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f'_y(h,0)-f'_y(0,0)}{h} = {{CT:11}} \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0;\">לפי בחירת המקדמים מתקיים \\({{CT:12}}\\ne{{CT:13}}\\), ולכן \\(f''_{xy}(0,0)\\ne f''_{yx}(0,0)\\). אין סתירה: שוויון הנגזרות המעורבות מובטח רק תחת תנאים נוספים, למשל רציפות מתאימה של הנגזרות מסדר שני בסביבה של הנקודה.</p>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:pfxx]] [[feedback:pfyy]] [[feedback:pfxy]] [[feedback:pfyx]] [[feedback:pcompare]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 14, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 14, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 14, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 14, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "pcompare", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans5", "tans": "2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pcompare-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>נכון.</strong> אין סתירה למשפט על שוויון הנגזרות המעורבות.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pcompare-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">עצם קיום שתי הנגזרות המעורבות בנקודה אינו מבטיח שהן שוות; נדרשים תנאים נוספים.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "pfxx", "value": 0.25, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pfxx-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">נכון. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f''_{xx}(0,0)\\)</span> חושבה נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pfxx-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">חשבו תחילה את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'_x(h,0)\\)</span> והשתמשו שוב בהגדרת הנגזרת.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "pfxy", "value": 0.2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "tans3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pfxy-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">נכון. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f''_{xy}(0,0)\\)</span> חושבה נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pfxy-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">בדקו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'_x(0,y)\\)</span> ליד הראשית.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "pfyx", "value": 0.2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans4", "tans": "tans4", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pfyx-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">נכון. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f''_{yx}(0,0)\\)</span> חושבה נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pfyx-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">בדקו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'_y(x,0)\\)</span> ליד הראשית.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "pfyy", "value": 0.25, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "tans2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pfyy-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">נכון. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f''_{yy}(0,0)\\)</span> חושבה נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pfyy-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">חשבו תחילה את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'_y(0,h)\\)</span> והשתמשו שוב בהגדרת הנגזרת.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt1", "value": 0, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["c", "cdpair", "coeffs", "d", "den", "e", "ff", "fx0", "fxaxis", "fxony", "fxx0", "fxy0", "fy0", "fyaxis", "fyonx", "fyx0", "fyy0", "m", "n", "num", "optequal", "p", "q", "tans1", "tans2", "tans3", "tans4"], "nvariants": 50}